ge-basketball/player/_/id/4278231/isaiah-whaley\">Isaiah Whaley</a> added three blocks. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4279789/rj-cole\">R.J. Cole</a> had seven rebounds.\n\n\r\n                    <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4067439/bryce-nze\">Bryce Nze</a> had 18 points for the Bulldogs (3-6, 2-4). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4278552/aaron-thompson\">Aaron Thompson</a> added 14 points and six assists. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4397026/bryce-golden\">Bryce Golden</a> had 10 points.\n\n\r\n                    ------\n\n\r\n                    For more AP college basketball coverage: https://apnews.com/Collegebasketball and http://twitter.com/AP--Top25\n\n\r\n                    ------\n\n\r\n                    This was generated by Automated Insights, http://www.automatedinsights.com/ap, using data from STATS LLC, https://www.stats.com","images":[]},"videos":[],"news":[],"source":{"summary":true,"boxscore":"full","playByPlay":"full"}}